{
 "title": "Middle Ages",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Middle Ages",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c158",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In Muslim Spain, in the 10th and 11th centuries,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c159",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jewish poets, doctors, and philosophers flourish.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c160",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Maimonides, born in Córdoba in 1138,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c161",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "becomes the most influential Jewish thinker of the Middle Ages",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c162",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and a physician at the court in Cairo.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c163",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Meanwhile in Christian Europe, the pressure builds.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c164",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1099, Crusaders captured Jerusalem",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c165",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and slaughter Muslims and Jews alike.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c166",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On the way,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c167",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Crusader mobs massacred Jewish communities along the Rhine.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c168",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jews are barred from owning land and joining guilds.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c169",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So many become money lenders,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c170",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "work that Christians are forbidden to do",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c171",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and are then hated for it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c172",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Lies spread that Jews poison wells",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c173",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that they murder Christian children for ritual blood.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c174",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "None of it is true and thousands die because of it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c175",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then the expulsions, England, 1290, France, 1306,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c176",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Spain, 1492, the same year Columbus sails.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c177",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Alhambra decree gives Spain's Jews",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c178",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a few months to convert or leave.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c179",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Tens of thousands go by some estimates far more.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c180",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Ottoman Sultan welcomes many of them.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c181",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They carry their Spanish with them, a language called Ladino.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c182",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in 1516, the city of Venice does something",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c183",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that gives the world a word.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c184",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It orders all its Jews to live on one small island",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c185",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "beside an old foundry locked in at night.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c186",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The island is called the Ghetto.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c187",
     "shot": "g_middleages",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The word spreads across Europe and so do the walls.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}